{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_title", "source_sha256": "d253ff7891c83dcb8ea8867bb3d7feb040f495a61cac4f10c9ded5ded9489967", "ja": "明日への軌跡", "zh": "通往明日的轨迹", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c7c119c303c4ce4def06dbc4fad49284c4fd176eaec5c55298d5836340da981f", "ja": "静香達のライブを観て、アイドルとしての姿\n勢に迷いを見せる千早。歌に打ち込むことは\n仲間に背を向けることではと怖れるが、どち\nらかひとつを選ぶものではないと気付き、公\n演でその新たな軌跡の第一歩を劇場に刻む。", "zh": "观赏了静香等人的演唱会后，千早开始对自身\n的偶像之路感到迷惘。她害怕一心投入歌唱的\n行为会导致自己和伙伴们渐行渐远，但在发现\n不需在两者间做选择后，千早站上公演舞台，\n在剧场中踏出了全新轨迹的第一步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1000_audience", "source_sha256": "a7fb915e7f9ba5f6a47cb38bd0ac0be0dc94b3c21f807b33e47c48112948d896", "ja": "わああああああああ！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ad25d9c070e7bcc33e11de050530a9ecb2a0cd636b8c51d6a456d5978edfae33", "ja": "（静香、ジュリア、恵美の公演は大成功！\n拍手喝采の中で無事幕を閉じた……）", "zh": "（静香、茱莉亚和惠美的演出非常成功！\n公演在一片喝采声中顺利落幕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1002_p", "source_sha256": "685ac4930e892263319144587dc587054bff8507b1b2786e323354fa6ddaf9f3", "ja": "お疲れさま！　いいステージだったぞ、\nお客さんも大満足してくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了！你们的表演相当精彩喔，\n观众们看起来也很尽兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "8d2df1dafb58da0b85d7c63f9f8be02487c3df4cda27e01d70f41db92b87ce46", "ja": "ミキもこっそり、一緒に歌っちゃった☆\nとっても楽しかったの！　ね、千早さん♪", "zh": "美希也偷偷跟着你们一起唱了☆\n很开心唷！对吧，千早♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "0f20412a7ba5a32e1d538cdb755948713e5d7ab7f219f42d24834983e297dc5b", "ja": "そうね。3人のステージと会場が、ひとつに\nなって……。とても良かったと思うわ。", "zh": "是啊，你们三人的表演和会场融为一体……\n真的非常棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "65ee2af83bd56d8b7e5bfa6ba81b4aa47780a7b9448dccfa867865eb4d7c37e9", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございますっ。\nでも、反省点もたくさんあって……まだまだだなって。", "zh": "谢、谢谢夸奖。\n不过，也有很多需要反省的地方……我们还差得远呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "11d7c929b461a782cd1d91f3594a44de231045eecc1913dd71d5b9af0ab253f9", "ja": "最初のステップとか、ちょっとズレちゃったよね～。\n練習ではバッチリだったんだけどっ。", "zh": "一开始我的舞步有点乱掉了～\n明明练习时都很完美的说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "b6ae9d4858ebf5662433dbe365af74a88f1c58dcb58fdddbcb322f596bd551e1", "ja": "あと何回か、歌が走りかけたよな。\nあはは、つい熱くなっちまってさ！", "zh": "唱歌时我也有好几次差点抢拍。\n啊哈哈，一不小心就太激动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "a20b81271f684e0f96b42c6a85829d356136943d262582e743105eb3037045d5", "ja": "もう、笑いごとじゃありませんっ。\nやっぱり反省会しないと……。", "zh": "真是的，这一点也不好笑。\n果然还是得开个检讨会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "7fe5d34801c0c176755eae1eead9080d56ca14396e321101723b3d2cb77912f6", "ja": "じゃあさ、打ち上げもかねてファミレスいかない？\n千早も美希もいくでしょ？", "zh": "那要不要去家庭餐厅检讨兼庆功？\n千早和美希也会来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "ee357ae7b95e42ad1c5074e16898405bf41b1d4233bfba9938e5c413bca6436e", "ja": "うんっ、いくのいくの！　\nミキ、イチゴババロアパフェが食べたいな♪", "zh": "嗯，要去要去！\n美希想吃草苺巴巴露亚圣代♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "225526d5d114ddbed194b36de66a19c6d20cf392b6b655566dab045e2d4ab25b", "ja": "千早さんも来てくれるんですか？\nそれならぜひ、詳しい感想を聞かせてください！", "zh": "千早也会来吗？\n那么请务必让我详细听听你的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "6e4b182a0b1c22af4a0e363cc1649d8f9c1974f8ea1c1c5603e92c4cb67a2163", "ja": "私は……ごめんなさい。\n今日は遠慮させてもらうわ。", "zh": "我……对不起。\n我今天就不去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "36216d35c00477f584ba715ffdc9b742d09e6522b786becaacd2445a001ea29d", "ja": "あ……そ、そうですよね。お忙しいのに……\nごめんなさい、ムリに誘ってしまって。", "zh": "啊……说、说得也是，你这么忙……\n我还硬要邀请你，真对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "6958a3acdb1e69d881f902901c6f664207c1cd407eb8aa1298c1659502b5a2dd", "ja": "違うの。ただ……じっとしていられなくて。\n{$P$}、レッスンルームを借りても？", "zh": "不是那样的，只是……我有点静不下来。\n{$P$}，练习室可以借我用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7f4c373b7e4f6099b9fe4c43de59edd686acf132c0daefa25d8467b3849f699f", "ja": "え、今からか？　構わないけど……。それじゃ、\nこっちで予約しておくよ。でも無理はするなよ？", "zh": "咦？现在吗？是可以……那我帮你预约吧。\n不过，别太勉强自己啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "1ee385b5b0d6ffc7d25a85332b6c2795305bc9c2cedb0c3ed5d17371dc147018", "ja": "ありがとうございます。静香、ジュリア、所さんも、\n今日はありがとう。ゆっくり休んでね。それじゃ……。", "zh": "谢谢你。静香、茱莉亚、所，今天很谢谢你们。\n要好好休息喔。我先走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "b6aa34c3bea1fcaca8bf8b672dac2558bfcd85593650055e9debca1dc7df06b2", "ja": "……とか言いながら、自分はレッスンかー。\n{$P$}、なんか、大丈夫なのかな？", "zh": "……叫我们休息，结果自己跑去练习啊～\n{$P$}，她那样没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1019_p", "source_sha256": "730fa576bccf79ee1c7a7af91a6df1c00f2754f0d73e94fc24123ca319694ec9", "ja": "ああ、様子を見に行ってみるよ。\n打ち上げは、先にお前達だけで行っててくれ。", "zh": "嗯，我跟过去看看。\n你们先自己去庆功吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "21a2c5ece745dc1228a37da5089038282d8c789100142630da0901388cc80306", "ja": "わかった。んじゃ、ウチらは着替えてファミレス行って\nその後、またカラオケでも行くか！", "zh": "知道了，那么我们先换衣服，\n去家庭餐厅吃完饭再去唱卡拉OK吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "3468d9961fdb9926b7968b2469678e2712e873f4dbdb5452b38e0ea76fba2db2", "ja": "おっ、いいねいいね！\n静香のリベンジチャーンス！みたいな。にゃはは♪", "zh": "哦，不错不错！\n是让静香雪耻的好机会呢！呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "596fc0f0e87d0d58232aecae614fb0c4c72aa263c35bdb3547b5d001b2c7db51", "ja": "べ、別にリベンジとか……というか、公演が終った\nばかりじゃないですか。それも反省点だと思いますっ。", "zh": "我、我才没有想要雪耻……\n话说，公演不是才刚结束吗？我觉得这点也该检讨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1023_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1025_p", "source_sha256": "eb89d943407b8fc4766486d65d276005cd1b4ffa4fdc32a97c6fd7884dfe574a", "ja": "もう着替えてたのか。\n千早、お疲れさま。", "zh": "你已经换好装啦？\n千早，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1026_002chi", "source_sha256": "551207266054fb22fbb7642bc6e89d7fbe505db61c772e311097bcf6300486f2", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}？\nあの……反省会は？", "zh": "咦，{$P$}？\n那个……检讨会呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1027_p", "source_sha256": "3a87267fc7d8e3ab4a542ce717bf3ed2eca314c6321a9e415887f26e00b033e6", "ja": "先に行ってもらったんだ。\nちょっと、千早と話がしたかったから。", "zh": "我让她们自己先去了。\n我想跟千早稍微聊聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1028_p", "source_sha256": "4d12c900d5bd1bd20f396d9551801402b965293ce914761a18ffdb7fb746ce16", "ja": "どうして静香達の公演を観たのか、とか、\n何を感じたのか、とか。", "zh": "像是你想看静香她们公演的原因，\n还有看完公演后的感受等等。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "09d5057e7b9a1bcbe67fe8b9a7c4e7c8f5a8b42cd50a2fdb2858de06f8bc7693", "ja": "あ……。すみません、ご心配をおかけして。\nそうですよね。", "zh": "啊……不好意思，让你担心了。\n果然还是会在意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "dc6ff1ff193eb28b75df0a50ef8d0181d0da94e4dbf7cdee0e8d7b2025aeeaf5", "ja": "じつは今、迷っています。\nこれから、歌とどう向き合っていくべきか。", "zh": "其实，我现在感到很迷惘，\n不知道今后该如何面对歌唱这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1031_p", "source_sha256": "41c750b452ac4745cffba3fa240e7e63923a7059387279def637772a3e20a04e", "ja": "……というと？", "zh": "……什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1032_002chi", "source_sha256": "e6108c9089dbab9eecdb7480de749f51b5194f4fd3c2ae60de659cb8ed27eaf2", "ja": "最近、劇場のみんなの公演を観て、感心してばかりで。\n今日の静香達も、桜守さんや白石さんの公演も。", "zh": "最近，剧场伙伴们的公演总是让我感到很佩服。\n像是今天静香她们的公演，还有樱守小姐和白石的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1033_002chi", "source_sha256": "050c77678c56c650935686dbfcfbfd46460dfa08d1b56e784f83b09c316fc746", "ja": "伝わってくるんです。まっすぐにステージや客席、\nそして自分とも向き合う真摯な気持ちが。", "zh": "我能够感受到她们那份坦率面对舞台、观众席，\n以及面对自己的真挚情感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "63a5b3629eb3d64a137419c7c50cea9e9c61e6018c55279fa82d8e643c906f55", "ja": "技術や表現で迷うことがあっても……\n向き合う気持ちは、とてもまっすぐで。", "zh": "即使会在技术或表现上感到迷惘……\n但她们依然会以无比坦率的心情去面对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ab2519ae89f7d19e2da0ccb5a8dfcf4a20ff676acf1f188eb244bf1955ccee22", "ja": "そうだな。\nでも、それは千早も同じじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊。\n不过，千早不也是如此吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1036_002chi", "source_sha256": "8f3f28b5d7d5155bb693162765ed1c1027a3f7bf326844caa3ea7b8cfb0e092a", "ja": "私の場合……\n以前はきっと、歌にしか興味が無かっただけです。", "zh": "我的情况是……\n以前的我只对歌唱有兴趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1037_002chi", "source_sha256": "f37cc0164c1050a7fb5c667a14b119f762c828e97c8d2d79b2fb2056c0312fe3", "ja": "他は全部、価値がないというか、灰色で。\nだからこそ、歌に……すがっていたのかと。", "zh": "其他一切事物对我来说都毫无价值、灰暗无趣。\n所以……我只能紧抓着歌唱这条路不放。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1038_p", "source_sha256": "1a9c0a79ea92bbfdc2d5bcad629c3ee5dc4d8d45d60a804fd770f8ae6afa607b", "ja": "でも……今は違うんだよな。", "zh": "但是……现在不一样了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1039_002chi", "source_sha256": "7594afb1efd754960f6c6ebe443760ae75a5be9ebf0e76a8e1c1894a2cdcd6d8", "ja": "はい。いろいろなものが色づいて見えて、\nうれしいです。でも……。", "zh": "是的，许多事物在我眼中都有了色彩，\n让我觉得很高兴，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1040_002chi", "source_sha256": "1835951d67d5f3ed265a63cb4ace22b5521279b6f564eccadc8d3fbe515acecb", "ja": "そんな優しい世界……仲間のみんなの気持ちに、\n私は、おぼれているのかもしれません。", "zh": "在这样温柔的世界里……\n我好像太过沉溺在与伙伴们之间的感情当中了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1041_002chi", "source_sha256": "39cce6ab4a70edce23419e68ff96ec6e93bfe94e9c5e705b7180a8fdd405ec6a", "ja": "みんなは違います。仲間と手を取り合いながらでも、\n自分の道をしっかり見据えて、力強く前に進んで。", "zh": "大家和我不一样，她们在彼此牵着手的同时，\n依然看得清属于自己的道路，并且坚定地向前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1042_002chi", "source_sha256": "0e67af788180002b4e51e1f9ba7492da406d82f3c45ac0130dce1da8cd0b41dc", "ja": "でも私は、みんなの優しさ、明るさに甘えたくて……。\nあえて立ち止まっている。", "zh": "但是，我却为了享受大家的温柔与光芒……\n而自己停下脚步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1043_002chi", "source_sha256": "a76d9840d0c8e05c7ce98f14b6c6fc391e7ef4a0a0e74eea14f302da6038b641", "ja": "歌と真剣に向き合うというのは、\n私にとって、一人になること。だから……。", "zh": "对我而言，想要真挚地面对歌唱，\n就必须重回孤独，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1044_p", "source_sha256": "2a7b986eecc25e36ba54564df64e2c33ad7d50810cb6b7b99c238be029ee58f0", "ja": "……だから避けてるってことか。\nでも……歌には向き合いたいんだろう？", "zh": "……所以才刻意避开大家吗。\n不过……你想要好好地面对歌唱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1045_002chi", "source_sha256": "3f6692bde502d3129cb9e2d817ed65f3a2c357c2f05f37ef14d42362e5378e14", "ja": "もちろんです！　でも、それは……。\n今とは違う孤高の道に進むこと。", "zh": "当然了！但是，那就代表……\n我必须踏上和现在相反的孤高之路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1046_002chi", "source_sha256": "ad6c03a26d217edd150c4b25005b753da6c25cdf9ca142b1569baf7be59cf55e", "ja": "どちらを選ぶのかと聞かれると……。\nきっと、本当は、どちらも……。", "zh": "如果问我要选择哪一边……\n想必我两边都不想放弃吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1047_p", "source_sha256": "d4b53ca801dd2d57c345ac1e395a44ab1abe3f329630402abde36e41b6ac6676", "ja": "なるほど……わかった。\nじゃあ……", "zh": "原来如此……我知道了。\n那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_1048", "source_sha256": "1bf94b88a644e7a214fc254bb0bb6f589998aa7faec64ff2592aa0bb9c2e26ac", "ja": "どっちも", "zh": "两边都选", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3000_p", "source_sha256": "3f224108becf779745f06e7f4c79dda9f0e647af2bc43c43c2c6ca1ddf7f0b81", "ja": "どっちもやろう。仲間と手を取り合いながら、\n時には一人になって、孤独に歌とだけ向き合って。", "zh": "两边都选吧，与伙伴携手同行，\n偶尔也回归自己一个人，独自面对歌唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3001_p", "source_sha256": "0fc8f1846ecc623291e9ae26356bd1c4520e186d47633dbc02bb4d3107a39a32", "ja": "それで寂しくなったら、またみんなの所……\nここに戻ってくればいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "要是感到寂寞，就再回到大家身边……\n回到这里来就好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3002_002chi", "source_sha256": "f5741e436c3bf6170ddf14499b9786f6beef820cfc80cbbaa18cc78c6b122140", "ja": "そ、それは、でも……\n都合がよすぎませんか？", "zh": "这、这个，但是……\n这样会不会太贪心了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3003_003mik", "source_sha256": "12eb3193847579f0edfd034ec46af2d469a95e7d71cfc73a1754369d63f036cf", "ja": "ミキは気にしないよ？", "zh": "美希不介意唷？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3004_002chi", "source_sha256": "db08c7c8b3afeb5f78e9049e1c9a3bd651cb7120a1ffa5bc3906bf6f605d6fbd", "ja": "美希！？　みんなと先に行ったんじゃ……？", "zh": "美希！？你不是跟大家一起先走了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3005_003mik", "source_sha256": "b453d533d7c0849990f2f5b804288259d2fa74c5cc12def178cb3efc2d449985", "ja": "{$P$}が遅いから、お迎えに来たの。\nあとね。", "zh": "{$P$}动作太慢，\n所以美希来接他了。还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3006_003mik", "source_sha256": "6c1112cd2b0aa437f638b18e2aeda36d435cd187d1652b13649f7f9877bca55d", "ja": "ミキは、ミキたちと一緒に歌う千早さんも、一人で\nどっか遠くを見てる千早さんも、両方好きなの♪", "zh": "无论是和美希我们一起唱歌的千早，\n还是独自抱着远大目标的千早，美希都很喜欢唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3007_003mik", "source_sha256": "2bab9ad176bd4aa33a61214ede2ee689a940e2c3a57aecc3a2d452a9c2bab051", "ja": "だからー、両方とも見てみたいな♪", "zh": "所以～美希两边都想看看呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3008_002chi", "source_sha256": "6924805f73d8f95ae6c519aa51b0e76e8bcc66941958afc87614bf027cf820ce", "ja": "美希……。", "zh": "美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3009_p", "source_sha256": "7e03432c893f72fec5e0a21c8d5ec4d8dc7f42dd022822300f92bc61a4c2b4f3", "ja": "……たぶん、道っていうのは選ぶものじゃなくて\nできるものなんじゃないかな。", "zh": "……我想，不是要从既定的路中做选择，\n而是要由你自己把路走出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3010_p", "source_sha256": "e9705e0a95d1bb6dc4153239b528a4dddd738cd8aa135be82b5b84b39498176b", "ja": "好きなときに、好きなところを歩けばいい。\n後ろにできた軌跡が、千早の選んだ道だよ。", "zh": "你可以在任何时候往自己想去的方向前进。\n千早走过的轨迹，就是你所选择的路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3011_002chi", "source_sha256": "299a46654f5a0cd28c70025ca43068f799576a91825a894f0077541f2895679f", "ja": "私の、軌跡……。", "zh": "我走过的，轨迹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3012_p", "source_sha256": "9edf9c47481ea4386b5c7032630e02076aaa826d57ca935b4f8cd1531cd48fad", "ja": "それに、千早が一人で歩き始めたとしても、\n本当に一人にはしてあげられない気もするし……。", "zh": "而且，就算千早走上自己的路，\n我想大家也不会放你一个人前进吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3013_002chi", "source_sha256": "b82bc951292d0b4655b7df73fc3bd686e7e0a53eecbe95fa13e12c931085fb60", "ja": "えっ？　そう……なんですか？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3014_p", "source_sha256": "29fadbf4de5e047a2b6162439607c36c4fe7e2c5db310bad3fbeec1dd4f1cd02", "ja": "ああ。少なくとも、\nプロデューサーはすぐそばにいないとな。", "zh": "是啊。\n至少会有个制作人跟在你身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3015_002chi", "source_sha256": "d430c5eaa0287dd43da4711396370f94a914bc14a0fdd921c56facae33537bc7", "ja": "あ…………。", "zh": "啊…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3016_003mik", "source_sha256": "62a68fd7725574a483f3b971228c6bec68b367fc5ea242a2c4927cf003af83d6", "ja": "あはっ、ミキも勝手に追いかけるからね♪\nあと、たぶん静香とか、みんなも♪　だよね、みんな☆", "zh": "啊哈，美希也会擅自追上去唷♪\n还有，静香跟大家应该也都一样♪对吧，大家☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3017_002chi", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3018_020meg", "source_sha256": "baa8ab5eceb1a4b0ba6eff1a35ee4f8c59a27f01c31eee9bb0b3ec6401b61648", "ja": "ちょっとダメじゃん！\n美希にバレてるよ！？", "zh": "结果还是跟踪失败嘛！\n我们被美希发现了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3019_050jul", "source_sha256": "12b2c6df5f3a64fa3adcc41c3fce95bbb449cc8bcd3f9ab38e4dad60f238adb2", "ja": "べ、別に、心配になって来ただけだっ。\n悪いことはしてないっ！", "zh": "我、我们只是因为担心才跟过来的。\n没有做什么坏事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3020_015siz", "source_sha256": "a837e138b96b0eac6af9e44b2da171e15f77110ed8313d6d047e41270b662359", "ja": "盗み聞きは悪いことですっ！\nうう、どうやって謝ろう……。", "zh": "偷听就是坏事！\n呜呜，这下该怎么道歉才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3021_002chi", "source_sha256": "96226803bfc77a8e711cb0b48e9b376645cc4cc8460078fb7ef89ba54b1f9d00", "ja": "ぷっ……ふふっ……ふふふっ！", "zh": "噗……呵呵……呵呵呵……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3022_002chi", "source_sha256": "07e7b2868e05fa1500a447cf888b55705cba503a37c89c6f5a3b794367b65564", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\n迷いは……消えました。綺麗に。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}。\n我的迷惘……已经消失了，消失得无影无踪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3023_p", "source_sha256": "41863636a34442a216e5d8dd5ee97ccf55fdce499ffea15b435f00f3f91dbfe7", "ja": "そうみたいだな。よかった。", "zh": "看来是呢，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3024_002chi", "source_sha256": "6ad003761838c2ac151afc2fae45ee9025f4074f4f4233e81cc2ff2b0d87a238", "ja": "美希もありがとう。\nあなたの言葉、とても……うれしかった。", "zh": "也谢谢美希。\n你刚才的话……让我非常开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3025_003mik", "source_sha256": "c84482c40adfce6f21691707887f0fdfa022065f93143ecad47437686d3959dd", "ja": "あはっ。ミキも今、うれしくなっちゃった♪\nどういたしまして、なの☆", "zh": "啊哈，美希现在也很开心♪\n不客气唷☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3026_002chi", "source_sha256": "6725ed147dc28684215df3c3a330a5fcafee7f5867d4c7522a05be30d2d86eb4", "ja": "それから、みんなも！\n心配かけてごめんなさい。", "zh": "还有各位！\n真对不起，让你们担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3027_p", "source_sha256": "e09d5e2b7290137a7ca4cc6cededf05f03710f93696c94bb8fed8ca8d814fb6c", "ja": "よし！　それじゃ、今度は俺のほうから、\nあらためて千早に話があるんだ。", "zh": "好！\n接着轮到我有事要告诉千早了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3028_p", "source_sha256": "08b992d60a206f5b2303e1fa477ed52bb19087e3332f64a9baebeff61c33e644", "ja": "次の劇場公演は、千早のセンター公演で行こうと\n思うんだけど……どうかな。やってくれるか？", "zh": "下次的剧场公演，我想让千早担任Center……\n怎么样，你愿意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3029_002chi", "source_sha256": "d5437e76ec588b02e478cc4a2eb85617014adfd5bdf955005b02f81b864e3e6d", "ja": "…………。\nはい。ぜひ、やらせてください！", "zh": "…………\n好的，请务必让我担任！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_047_3030_002chi", "source_sha256": "952b82645d1e2a9d1667334991800215f050404ae3fba5f6ad7759ae9b77c33b", "ja": "これからの私の道の、最初の一歩……。\nこの劇場から始めます！", "zh": "我今后的道路……\n第一步就从这个剧场开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
